OL,3,GNEWSAAbuser jailed for attack on latest
OL,4,Apartner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA domestic abuser who has a history of
OL,7,Fviolence against partners and poses a
OL,8,Fhigh risk to women has been jailed for
OL,9,Fhis latest attack.
OL,11,FCorey Pickering, 28, knocked his last
OL,12,Fvictim unconscious and left her with a
OL,13,Fbloodied and swollen eye in June,
OL,14,FTeesside Crown Court heard.
OL,16,FA judge said Pickering, who in 2024 was
OL,17,Fgiven a suspended sentence for coercive
OL,18,Fcontrol and assault of a previous
OL,19,Fpartner, had a "willingness to use
OL,20,Fviolence" against women and a sense of
OL,21,Fentitlement.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
